# ===== HISTOIRE 10/10 — DÜSSELDORF / KRAFTWERK (1974-78) =====
# Kraftwerk : la synthèse devient POP. Séquence motorik, voix au VOCODEUR,
# mélodies carrées — l'ADN de la techno, de l'electro et de la house à venir.
title:  Roboter
bpm:    128
key:    a minor
duck:   30
scene:  network
song:   intro*4 main*12 out*4
motor:  1 1 1' 1 1 1 5, 1 1 1 1' 1 1 1 6, 1 | square | pwm 0.4 | lp 1400 | gate 0.4 | delay 0.25 | gain 0.12 | in main out
bass:   1 . 1 . 5, . 1 . 1 . 1 . 6, . 5, . | saw | oct 2 | lp 700 | gate 0.5 | gain 0.15 | in main out
melody: 1' . 7 . 5 . 3 . | square | lp 2000 | delay 0.3 | gate 0.5 | gain 0.1 | in main
vox:    1 . 3 . 5 . 1' . | saw | unison 3 | vocode vox | reverb 0.3 | gain 0.1 | in main
kick:   x . . . x . . . x . . . x . . . | sample bd | gain 0.4 | in main out
clap:   . . . . x . . . . . . . x . . . | sample cp | gain 0.3 | in main
